~ start
if QuestManager.talked_to_team["Novius"] == true:
	=> novius_followup
novius: Hey, Astryn.
astryn: Nov. What you doing?
novius: Just scouting the local magic shops. Inflation here is insane. Mana crystals are priced like luxury goods.
if QuestManager.talked_to_team["Aegrandir"] == true:
	Astryn: Yeah, Aeg was telling me about that. Vorkoth has the economy completely cooked.
else:
	Astryn: Damn, and here I was hoping to grab some magic items too.
novius: Shit's crazy, caught some news too.
astryn: Glad you can still read my mind. Spill it.
novius: Word on the street is that Vorkoth can wield dark magic. Overheard some guys outside a shop, they were talking about our duel. Seems the word has spread.
astryn: Dark magic… shit. We better prepare our fundamentals. Still silly to me that the basic stuff works best against the forbidden stuff.
novius: Yep. Not my best matchup…
astryn: It's cool, that’s what you got me for. Anything else?
novius: They also mentioned he infuses his physical attacks with fire magic. Dual-casting.
astryn: Both fire and dark, hmmm. Hybrid then.
novius: Yeah. This’ll be a tough one.
astryn: Thanks, Nov. See ya around.
novius: Later, captain.
do QuestManager.mark_as_talked_to("Novius")
=> END

~ novius_followup
do CinematicBars.show_bars()
if QuestManager.novius_bonded == true:
	Novius: Go get some rest, captain. Tonight's gonna be a long one.
	=> END
novius: Hey... Before tonight—
astryn: What's up?
novius: I don't say this stuff much. But I'm glad you're the one leading this. I mean that.
astryn: ...You good, Nov?
novius: Yeah. Just — a guy like Vorkoth makes you think about people you couldn't save. Makes you want to make sure you don't lose anyone else.
astryn: Nobody's losing anybody tonight.
novius: Damn right.
do QuestManager.novius_bonded = true
=> END